  "story": {
    "text": "At home, Beth grows {WEAKER} through the spring. The family gives her the best room, with her piano, her {KITTENS}, and the window full of {SUNSHINE}. She sews little things for the {SCHOOLCHILDREN} who pass by. Then one {MORNING}, with Jo beside her, Beth draws her last {BREATH}.",
